        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F93BRK, Brookshire Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are as sick of the same old handlesets as we are, then you'll love the Dummy Cylinder Brookshire Handleset. It has fantastic detailing that really grants it an old world feel while still seeming perfectly placed in today's modern world. The Brookshire Dummy Handleset  is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-brookshire-handleset-schlage-f60brk\"><b>Brookshire Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Brookshire Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Brookshire Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-7/16\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-3/8\" to 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 13-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BRK-hand-specifications.pdf?v=1704262315\"><b>Schlage Brookshire Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish. The Andover Knob is not available in Matte Black. The Flair Lever is not available in Matte Black. The Avanti Lever is not available in Bright Brass or Matte Black. </i></p>",
